                  {
                    "id": "PRRC_kwDODKw3uc6G8AGk",
                    "body": "When fetching the ref SHA of a tag, a partial semver match returns a 200 response with an empty body, which causes the JSON decode to fail.\r\nFor example, if the tag is v1.0.0, only refs/tags/v1.0.0 will work — v1 or v1.0 will return 200 with empty body.\r\n\r\nThis behavior aligns with other gh release commands, which also require the exact tag name, otherwise would return release not found. Partial semver versions won’t work — only the full, exact tag is accepted.",
                    "createdAt": "2025-08-08T19:51:33Z",
